{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e6b143b1d11747299ccdb2a87c684b5285612cdf08428eb274a38e7266540eeb", "ja": "よし。キャッチボールはこんなものでいいだろう。\nそれじゃあ始球式しっかりな、まつり！", "zh": "好，投接球这样就行了吧。\n那么开球典礼要好好表现啊，茉莉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "ab8e5834a878f67ed39dc000643bd23b73766e041329fdbaa50068cf71eab4c5", "ja": "はいなのです！　でも姫、ちっともストライクが\n入らなかったのです。うまくできるか心配なのですー。", "zh": "好的喔！可是公主完全投不进好球带，\n很担心能不能做得好的唷～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_1003_p", "source_sha256": "5b046e15e029cd3790e3fec88820881c271319188cb05bbfca7a4ee5c1edb7a5", "ja": "けど、一球すごくいい球があったな。\nその気になれば、剛速球も投げられるんじゃないか？", "zh": "不过，有一球投得非常好啊。\n你有那个心的话，说不定连刚速球都投得出来吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "9e43c6d6ac659545f067639cfd4f35ae2c995feaf37a89d8ab56d4137e472f03", "ja": "……ほ？　何のことだかわからないのです。\n姫はかよわいのです。", "zh": "……哦？公主不懂你在说什么呢。\n公主很娇弱的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b1d3b25e8d7c86776d28bb7334a5d96cf70ac38cf36f7a4bc610e27963fa12c3", "ja": "え、でもミットで受けたとき、いい音が……。", "zh": "咦，但是手套接到球的时候，发出了响亮的声音……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_021mat_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_021mat_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "7d8a4283d8a1abfe5f72c06bcc18e16a23df2d500bdd0c13f9bf775c91edd973", "ja": "姫はかよわいのです、{$P$}さん。\n……ね？　きっと妖精さんのいたずらなのです。", "zh": "公主很娇弱的，{$P$}先生。\n……呐？那一定是妖精在恶作剧的喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
